#: data/maps/PacifidlogTown_House1/scripts.inc:12
msgctxt "PacifidlogTown_House1_Text_RegiStory"
msgid ""
"In the HOENN region, there are three\n"
"POKéMON that represent the power of\l"
"rock, ice, and steel.\p"
"Each of them is said to hide away deep\n"
"inside caves.\p"
"That's the story I heard when I was\n"
"just a little kid.$"
msgstr ""
"在丰缘地区，有三只宝可梦\n"
"分别代表着岩石、冰和钢的力量。\p"
"据说它们各自\n"
"藏在洞窟的深处。\p"
"这是我很小的时候\n"
"听到的故事。$"

#: data/maps/PacifidlogTown_House1/scripts.inc:21
msgctxt "PacifidlogTown_House1_Text_SixDotsOpenThreeDoors"
msgid ""
"“Six dots open three doors.”\p"
"Grandpa used to say that, but I don't\n"
"know what he meant.$"
msgstr ""
"“六个点打开三扇门。”\p"
"爷爷以前常这么说，\n"
"可我不知道是什么意思。$"
